\alttext(The affine feature plane and aligned3x3 output share[0,21]. The derivative footprint uses[0,1.5];its entries sum to nine. Output-minus-oracle differences use[-1e-5,1e-5]. Native independent border/fractional oracles check every value and derivative.)

> Class-specific sigmoid masks

Each positive region has one foreground class label \(c_k\),and only that
mask channel receives a gradient. Masks use independent sigmoid probabilities,
not a softmax across classes. With K positive regions and SxS pixels,

$$L_{mask}=\frac1{KS^2}\sum_{k,u,v}\left[\operatorname{softplus}(z_{kuvc_k})-t_{kuv}z_{kuvc_k}\right],\qquad
\frac{\partial L}{\partial z_{kuvc}}=\frac{\mathbf1[c=c_k]}{KS^2}\left[\sigma(z_{kuvc})-t_{kuv}\right].$$
\alttext(The mask loss is the average binary cross entropy of the matched foreground channel;every other channel has zero derivative.)

For a2x2 region with zero logits,selected-class gradients are plus/minus1/8
when K=2,while all wrong-class derivatives are exactly zero. The scalar loss
is log(2). Empty positives return a differentiable zero. Support targets are
nearest pixel-centre crops from the highest-box-IoU object(first truth on ties),
and that object's class must agree with the sampled region. They are not a
union foreground mask. No optimizer runs in these arithmetic checks.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/mask_rcnn_selected.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>

#include <print>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  auto z = n::zeros({2, 2, 2, 3}).requires_grad_();
  const auto target = n::tensor({0., 1., 0., 1., 1., 1., 0., 0.}, {2, 2, 2});
  const auto loss = n::models::SelectedInstanceMaskLoss(
      z, n::from_vector(std::vector<std::int64_t>{0, 2}), target);
  const auto gradient = n::grad(loss, {z})[0];
  auto selected = n::plot_tensor_map(
           n::reverse(n::slice_axis(n::slice_axis(gradient, 0, 0, 1), 3, 0, 1).reshape({2, 2}),
                      {0}),
           -.15, .15),
       wrong = n::plot_tensor_map(
           n::reverse(n::slice_axis(n::slice_axis(gradient, 0, 0, 1), 3, 1, 2).reshape({2, 2}),
                      {0}),
           -.15, .15);
  selected.title("Selected class derivative");
  wrong.title("Wrong class: zero derivative");
  std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
  dm::graphics::RLayout::create(1, 2)
      .add(selected)
      .add(wrong)
      .size(1100, 480)
      .fit_panels()
      .save_svg("build/mask_rcnn_selected.svg");
  if (std::abs(loss.item() - std::log(2.)) > 1e-7)
    return 1;
  std::print("Selected-class BCE {:.9f};first region selected gradients -/+.125,wrong classes "
             "exactly zero.\n",
             loss.item());
}
```
