> Actual images and individual supports

First2048 training-source MNIST digits generate80 scenes(seed11):64 fitting
and16 validation. First512 test-source digits generate eight held-out scenes
(seed22). Each attempted digit has a16..32px rescaled cell;its tight box and
individual support follow pixels brighter than32 after byte rounding. Rejecting
box overlap keeps this teaching task simpler than real instance segmentation.
The canonical tensor sampler retains the original discrete draw order;bilinear
borderline rounding may differ by one byte from the old host implementation.
The first four actual fitting images and their coloured supports appear below.
Colours identify digit labels using the documented ten-class palette.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/mask_rcnn_data.png", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>

#include <print>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  namespace m = n::models;

  std::filesystem::path cache;
  if (const auto *p = std::getenv("DATAMUNGE_DATA_DIR"))
    cache = p;
  else if (const auto *p = std::getenv("XDG_CACHE_HOME"))
    cache = std::filesystem::path(p) / "datamunge/datasets";
  else
    cache = std::filesystem::path(std::getenv("HOME")) / ".cache/datamunge/datasets";
  dm::datasets::fetch("mnist", (cache / "mnist").string());

  const auto digits = n::load_mnist((cache / "mnist").string(), "train");
  m::DetectionSceneConfig cfg;
  cfg.scenes = 80;
  cfg.seed = 11;
  cfg.max_overlap = 0;
  const auto scenes = m::MakeTensorInstanceScenes(
      n::slice_axis(digits.images, 0, 0, 2048), n::slice_axis(digits.labels, 0, 0, 2048), cfg);
  std::filesystem::create_directories("build");
  n::save_image_grid(m::InstanceMaskPreview(scenes), "build/mask_rcnn_data.png", 1, 0, 1, 4,
                     1., 3);
  std::print(
      "80 actual64px MNIST training-source scenes:rows0..63 fit,64..79 validation;first four "
      "image/truth-support pairs shown. Up to four attempted digits,nonoverlapping tight "
      "boxes;support is resampled byte>32. Validation never supplies optimization targets.\n");
}
