// result_end
\caption(All three unregularized training objectives and the validation box AP50 selection trace. The code visibly optimizes every learned branch and restores the selected checkpoint before mask evaluation.)
\alttext(All three unregularized training objectives and the validation box AP50 selection trace. The code visibly optimizes every learned branch and restores the selected checkpoint before mask evaluation.)

The selected epoch30 has validation box AP50.868659. Test box AP50.806614
and integral mask AP50.806614 fall to mask AP75.370370,showing that many
recognized objects still have inaccurate support boundaries. Eight test scenes
contain only26 digits,so these bounded results do not estimate benchmark accuracy.

\image(figures/mask_rcnn_predictions.png)
\caption(First four actual held-out image/truth/prediction triples. Truth and predicted supports use the same digit palette;higher-scored predictions overlay lower-scored supports. Missing,extra and incorrectly labelled instances remain visible.)
\alttext(Four held-out MNIST scenes paired with true individual supports and actual restored Mask R-CNN masks.)

> Conclusion

Independent interpolation and derivative checks precede full mask-head execution and complete compact fitting. Visible optimization,validation box selection and true held-out support galleries expose the limits of the bounded digit experiment. Reported integral mask AP remains distinct from the official COCO protocol;no pretrained benchmark result is claimed.

> References

- [He,Gkioxari,Dollár and Girshick (2017),Mask R-CNN](https://arxiv.org/abs/1703.06870).
- [Ren et al.(2015),Faster R-CNN](https://arxiv.org/abs/1506.01497).
